{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/敛锋之姿","pageid":8492,"revid":21056,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%95%9B%E9%94%8B%E4%B9%8B%E5%A7%BF&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%95%9B%E9%94%8B%E4%B9%8B%E5%A7%BF&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%95%9B%E9%94%8B%E4%B9%8B%E5%A7%BF&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>敛锋之姿</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E6.95.9B.E9.94.8B.E4.B9.8B.E5.A7.BF\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"敛锋之姿\"><b>敛锋之姿</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 敛锋之姿.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/b1/60gui5tcqk80cpwtzfbc05xn0nz4caz.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%95%9B%E9%94%8B%E4%B9%8B%E5%A7%BF.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/b1/60gui5tcqk80cpwtzfbc05xn0nz4caz.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%95%9B%E9%94%8B%E4%B9%8B%E5%A7%BF.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/b1/60gui5tcqk80cpwtzfbc05xn0nz4caz.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />敛锋之姿\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>1\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>0-0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>正前方半圆4格\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（支援）选择方向，对正前方半圆<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>格内所有敌人，施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼物防2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▼物防2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"×反应技\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">×反应技</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合；自身获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"敛锋\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">敛锋</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"抵抗初级\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">抵抗初级</font></span></span>]，持续到下次行动开始；以及获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲攻击2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲攻击2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲暴击2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲暴击2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲物防2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲物防2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲魔防2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲魔防2</font></span></span>]，持续2回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-0 正前方半圆4格.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/a5/0duw9bvodjw42ggazlgzycrtowr4u53.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-0_%E6%AD%A3%E5%89%8D%E6%96%B9%E5%8D%8A%E5%9C%864%E6%A0%BC.png.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/a5/0duw9bvodjw42ggazlgzycrtowr4u53.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-0_%E6%AD%A3%E5%89%8D%E6%96%B9%E5%8D%8A%E5%9C%864%E6%A0%BC.png.jpeg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/a5/0duw9bvodjw42ggazlgzycrtowr4u53.png/160px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-0_%E6%AD%A3%E5%89%8D%E6%96%B9%E5%8D%8A%E5%9C%864%E6%A0%BC.png.jpeg 2x\" data-file-width=\"743\" data-file-height=\"743\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div st